    ],
    "text": "By virtue of powers vested in me by Section 27(1)(b) read with Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, 1, Dr. A. D. Susil Premajayantha, the Minister of Education having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act. No. 7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number GL 24, being recognized as a degree awarding institute, do by this Order amend the Schedule II to the Order made under the said Act and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2384/28 of May 16, 2024, by the addition immediately after entry \u201cBachelor of Arts Honours in English Studies\u201d appearing in Column I and it\u2019s corresponding entry in Column II thereof, of the entries specified under Column I and II respectively of the Schedule II hereto, subject to the conditions specified in schedule I hereto :-",
